 Arc De Triomphe by bus? <br/>    <span class=\"strong\">Allen</span>:  Go straight ahead to that bus stop. Take the # 95 bus North and get off at \u00c9toile."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "north "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the direction that is at the top of a map"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Head north on this street."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to dive directions in a city. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toward"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in the direction of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Walk toward the building."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "entrance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a space that you go through to enter a place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Go down the stairs of the entrance. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "complicated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult to understand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That sounds complicated. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "underground path"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a track that you can walk on under the ground "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The underground path takes you there."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ticket booth "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place where you can buy tickets "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The platform is in front of the ticket booth."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "westbound"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "travelling towards the west"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Take the westbound train."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pathway "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a path a person can walk along"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Walk to the end of the pathway."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le01ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (5-7 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There is a tourist in your city. They are lost and need directions to a place. They ask you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give them directions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue aloud with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask and give directions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use prepositions of place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice with a partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I switch roles."}]}], "type": "sena"}